<title>ESTONIA: Estonia central bank foreign reserves fall in Oct.</title>
<headline>Estonia central bank foreign reserves fall in Oct.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Estonia's foreign reserves fell slightly in October, the bank said in a brief statement on Monday.</p>
<p>Foreign reserves fell to 7.189 billion kroons in October from 7.211 billion kroons in September.</p>
<p>-- Riga newsroom +371 721 52 40</p>
